{
  "slug": "champion-kit",
  "name": "Champion Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Help Claude Code champions run hackathons and office hours, find patterns worth sharing, help teammates climb the steps of AI adoption, and write a shareable AI maturity report.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `climb` (Work out where a teammate, the champion, or a team is on the steps of AI adoption, and…), `faq` (Turn repeat questions into a pinned FAQ), `hackathon` (Plan a hackathon, either from a team's real backlog or as open-ended creative play with Claude Code), `maturity` (Evaluate an organization's AI maturity on the steps of AI adoption and write a polished, shareable HTML report…), `office-hours` (Set up and run Claude Code office hours, including the calendar event when the champion's own calendar connector…), `patterns` (Find patterns worth sharing from recent PRs and repo history, both repeats to fix and good practices worth…), `routines` (Set up recurring champion routines as Claude Code scheduled tasks)\n- **Agents** (1): `repo-scout` (Evidence gatherer for champion-kit skills)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install champion-kit@claude-plugins-official` from `anthropics/claude-plugins-official` (`plugins/champion-kit`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 1
  },
